    <string name="connect_desc_connected">Connected. Keep Developer options on, with Wireless debugging or USB debugging, and the lights keep working.</string>
    <string name="connect_desc_needs_setup">HiLight Plus needs a one-time connection to reach the rear lights. It takes about a minute, with no extra app to install.</string>
